      "content": "The world doesn't swallow you up; it simply moves so fast that you cannot catch your breath, and that is the only truth you need to accept. You do not need to carve out a space for yourself if the world is already too loud to hear your own heartbeat. The point isn't to be seen by others, but to be present in the silence of your own mind, even if it feels empty.",
