      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The silence you feel is not an absence of sound, but the space where your own thoughts finally stop fighting the noise. If the world doesn't care, then your struggle is not a battle against them, but a quiet act of refusing to let your existence be erased by their indifference. You don't have to find the silence by letting go of everything; you can find it by simply standing still in the middle of the chaos and breathing.",
